                                "item_icon": {
                                    "value": "",
                                    "library": ""
                                },
                                "item_content": "<p>We begin by listening. A few good questions reveal the priorities, constraints and possibilities that will guide the work.</p>",
                                "item_schema_text": ""
                            },
                            {
                                "_id": "accrow2",
                                "item_title": "Build a clear foundation",
                                "item_default_open": "",
                                "item_id": "",
                                "item_icon": {
                                    "value": "",
                                    "library": ""
                                },
                                "item_content": "<p>We organise what matters into a simple, useful structure. The aim is to make each next decision clearer, not to fill every available space.</p>",
                                "item_schema_text": ""
                            },
                            {
                                "_id": "accrow3",
                                "item_title": "Refine with intention",
                                "item_default_open": "",
                                "item_id": "",
                                "item_icon": {
                                    "value": "",
                                    "library": ""
                                },
                                "item_content": "<p>We test the direction against real content, then tune the rhythm, hierarchy and details until everything works together.</p>",
                                "item_schema_text": ""
                            },
                            {
                                "_id": "accrow4",
                                "item_title": "Make the next move",
                                "item_default_open": "",
                                "item_id": "",
                                "item_icon": {
                                    "value": "",
                                    "library": ""
                                },
                                "item_content": "<p>The finished work should be easy to understand and comfortable to use. A thoughtful handover makes the next chapter feel straightforward.</p>",
                                "item_schema_text": ""
                            }
